{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Ironman shows the PvP level-range notice only for players the core would let it fight",
  "contract": "Ironman - Resolute 1x Experience (52) carries ONLY_PVP_IN_5_LEVEL_RANGE. An area spell tests every unit in its radius with IsValidAttackTarget, so a level 1 Human warrior on that challenge who casts Thunder Clap (6343) next to a level 10 Human of the same faction must not see 'Your challenge restricts who you may fight in PvP.': the core never lets them fight. Attacking a PvP-enabled level 10 Orc, whom the core would let them fight, is refused with that notice.",
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
